     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace;display:inline\">​Yes.​</div> </div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gaDqzl7D3tI/WgME7w8_INI/AAAAAAAAAHo/daVADLPFx7A71_INrxIFSihhTSG4YI4JQCLcBGAs/s1600/mapaustria.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gaDqzl7D3tI/WgME7w8_INI/AAAAAAAAAHo/daVADLPFx7A71_INrxIFSihhTSG4YI4JQCLcBGAs/s1600/mapaustria.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366827868000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3R6yRcTXYwMyPMaIjByrE7\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gaDqzl7D3tI/WgME7w8_INI/AAAAAAAAAHo/daVADLPFx7A71_INrxIFSihhTSG4YI4JQCLcBGAs/s320/mapaustria.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"197\"></a></p><span><font color=\"#888888\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p></font></span></div></blockquote><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">​Although you didn&#39;t ask, I assume you want to know _how_ it can be done :-). Try this:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\"><br></div></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">​<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace\">theme(panel.border = element_bl</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace\">ank())</span></div><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">​Best,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">Ista​</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span><font color=\"#888888\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><br></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366827868000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3IrhV22XfXnfRmsdUexsDk\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+unsubscribe@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366827868000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3esmp6S75Hv3M9PRBG2wNE\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+unsubscribe@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=